## Modèle DB — `PushToken`

```prisma
model PushToken {
  id        String       @id @default(uuid()) @db.Uuid
  userId    String       @map("user_id") @db.Uuid
  user      User         @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  token     String       @unique @db.VarChar(255) // ExpoPushToken[xxx]
  platform  PushPlatform // IOS | ANDROID
  active    Boolean      @default(true) // false si DeviceNotRegistered
  createdAt DateTime     @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime     @updatedAt

  @@index([userId, active])
}

enum PushPlatform {
  IOS
  ANDROID
}
```

**Endpoints** (RBAC self) :
- `POST /v1/me/push-tokens` (CLIENT, PRESTATAIRE) — register/update idempotent.
- `DELETE /v1/me/push-tokens/{token}` (CLIENT, PRESTATAIRE) — logout / désinstall.

