## Variables d'environnement (Zod boot)

| Variable | Validation | Exemple |
|---|---|---|
| `RESEND_API_KEY` | `z.string().startsWith('re_').min(20)` en prod, optional en dev | `re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxx` |
| `EMAIL_FROM` | `z.string().email()` | `noreply@cleanconnect.fr` |
| `EMAIL_FROM_NAME` | `z.string().min(1).max(80)` | `Clean Connect` |
| `EMAIL_REPLY_TO` | `z.string().email()` | `support@cleanconnect.fr` |
| `EXPO_ACCESS_TOKEN` | `z.string().min(20).optional()` | `expo_xxxxxxx` |

